flowchart TB
Visitor[Visitor] --> Site[Company frontend public paths]
Staff[Staff] --> Portal[Authenticated Portal frontend]
Site --> API[Fastify public API]
Portal --> Auth[Session CSRF and role checks]
Auth --> API
API --> CMS[Content drafts facts revisions and publication]
API --> HR[Recruitment applications and owned file metadata]
API --> Enquiry[Persist enquiry before notification]
CMS --> PG[Portal PostgreSQL]
HR --> PG
Enquiry --> PG
HR --> Bucket[Private object storage]
PG --> Worker[Oracle staging worker]
Worker --> Scan[ClamAV Unix socket]
Worker --> Mail[SMTP or Resend conditional adapter - delivery not qualified]
Worker --> Deletion[Durable storage deletion outbox]
API --> Audit[Audit events without document bodies]
